12:     - Exactly one teal control pixel is 4-connected into one sprite.
13:     - The marked multicolor component has a 3x3 bounding box and exactly one
14:       non-teal foreground color.
15: 
16:     Rule
17:     - Find the 4-connected foreground component containing the teal marker.
18:     - Crop that component's bounding box.
19:     - Output the component mask inside the crop, replacing both the marker and
20:       the sprite pixels with the component's non-teal color.
21: 
22:     Key insight
23:     - The teal pixel selects the sprite to summarize; the other sprites are
24:       distractors.
